        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.webp?t=1758394742\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" class=\"bb_img\" width=459 height=225 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/a18ee7a09fd343570a49b97582ca96e1.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Sapo Xulé and Unwanted Marriage&quot; our hero uses his skills in “Kung-Foot Odor” to defeat the Sapo King's army and the Henchmen's Syndicate, in order to prevent the forced marriage of his beloved with the ruler of Sapópolis .  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STINKY FEET INCLUDED, BE CAREFUL!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/78954fa3ee44e49c8ad23a2658e6db23.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/78954fa3ee44e49c8ad23a2658e6db23.webm?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/78954fa3ee44e49c8ad23a2658e6db23.mp4?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/6b43e8c89268a3f90b63663e40da2094.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried about his low popularity, Sapo King, the mayor of Sapópolis (and self-styled King), discovers that the population longs for a first lady! To resolve the situation, he orders the snake Sibila to create a love potion to be used on the “candidate” for marriage. The problem is the chosen one: Sapita, the most fragrant and beautiful frog in the city, and Sapo Xulé's “girlfriend”. Upon learning, our hero sets out to rescue his beloved, but will encounter many challenges along the way, such as the Royal Guard and the Henchmen's Syndicate, who will do everything to stop him in time for the wedding to take place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/dcb9a6ec970f7cedd68b40b833aeee5a.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/dcb9a6ec970f7cedd68b40b833aeee5a.webm?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/dcb9a6ec970f7cedd68b40b833aeee5a.mp4?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/12555ba9e3f43345ff6c6045cfa284fb.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Sapo Xulé's iconic return to the world of games, in his first game fully developed for the character and his universe, taking advantage of elements from all the media in which he previously participated;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 2D platform game with graphics handcrafted by the character's creator, artist Paulo José;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Six levels/worlds with themed stages and boss battles;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• In addition to the “Kung-Foot Odor” attacks, the hero will have the help of the little fly Dorotéia, which will help him collect items and increase his range when jumping and moving;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Shop for purchasing items and unlockables that go back to Sapo Xulé's 30-year history (Comics, Animated Series, Vídeos, Etc.); </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Original soundtrack created by musicians Leandro and Nelton Matioli;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Original Game Engine created by Squash Studios;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Casual Mode (perfect for kids or for those who just want to enjoy the adventure without worrying about difficulty);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5efe37fd49b604fe878430d2cb39dbea.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5efe37fd49b604fe878430d2cb39dbea.webm?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5efe37fd49b604fe878430d2cb39dbea.mp4?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5b05818f2253df95aaf1a473f922ccd1.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.webp?t=1758394742\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" class=\"bb_img\" width=459 height=225 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/a18ee7a09fd343570a49b97582ca96e1.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Sapo Xulé and Unwanted Marriage&quot; our hero uses his skills in “Kung-Foot Odor” to defeat the Sapo King's army and the Henchmen's Syndicate, in order to prevent the forced marriage of his beloved with the ruler of Sapópolis .  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STINKY FEET INCLUDED, BE CAREFUL!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/78954fa3ee44e49c8ad23a2658e6db23.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/78954fa3ee44e49c8ad23a2658e6db23.webm?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/78954fa3ee44e49c8ad23a2658e6db23.mp4?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/6b43e8c89268a3f90b63663e40da2094.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried about his low popularity, Sapo King, the mayor of Sapópolis (and self-styled King), discovers that the population longs for a first lady! To resolve the situation, he orders the snake Sibila to create a love potion to be used on the “candidate” for marriage. The problem is the chosen one: Sapita, the most fragrant and beautiful frog in the city, and Sapo Xulé's “girlfriend”. Upon learning, our hero sets out to rescue his beloved, but will encounter many challenges along the way, such as the Royal Guard and the Henchmen's Syndicate, who will do everything to stop him in time for the wedding to take place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/dcb9a6ec970f7cedd68b40b833aeee5a.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/dcb9a6ec970f7cedd68b40b833aeee5a.webm?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/dcb9a6ec970f7cedd68b40b833aeee5a.mp4?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/12555ba9e3f43345ff6c6045cfa284fb.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Sapo Xulé's iconic return to the world of games, in his first game fully developed for the character and his universe, taking advantage of elements from all the media in which he previously participated;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 2D platform game with graphics handcrafted by the character's creator, artist Paulo José;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Six levels/worlds with themed stages and boss battles;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• In addition to the “Kung-Foot Odor” attacks, the hero will have the help of the little fly Dorotéia, which will help him collect items and increase his range when jumping and moving;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Shop for purchasing items and unlockables that go back to Sapo Xulé's 30-year history (Comics, Animated Series, Vídeos, Etc.); </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Original soundtrack created by musicians Leandro and Nelton Matioli;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Original Game Engine created by Squash Studios;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Casual Mode (perfect for kids or for those who just want to enjoy the adventure without worrying about difficulty);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5efe37fd49b604fe878430d2cb39dbea.poster.avif?t=1758394742\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5efe37fd49b604fe878430d2cb39dbea.webm?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5efe37fd49b604fe878430d2cb39dbea.mp4?t=1758394742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667990/extras/5b05818f2253df95aaf1a473f922ccd1.avif?t=1758394742\" width=600 height=105 /></span></p>",
